WEBVTT

00:02:00.032 --> 00:02:01.701
to negotiate their wages,

00:02:01.701 --> 00:02:03.911
hours and working conditions,

00:02:03.953 --> 00:02:06.414
all in competition with other workers

00:02:06.455 --> 00:02:09.292
and frequently with limited
English proficiency.

00:02:09.333 --> 00:02:12.503
This rapid pace of the hiring process,

00:02:12.545 --> 00:02:13.754
unstable work,

00:02:13.796 --> 00:02:15.756
lack of immigration status

00:02:15.798 --> 00:02:18.843
and working on one of the least regulated
sectors of the economy

00:02:18.843 --> 00:02:22.305
makes day laborers particularly
vulnerable to wage theft,

00:02:22.346 --> 00:02:24.891
as well as other forms of exploitation,

00:02:24.891 --> 00:02:27.685
harassment and victimization.

